<view class="panel"><text>添加本市师傅</text><view>同一师傅可加入多个门店。工资按订单所属门店分别审核和结算。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="change"><label wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.checked}}"/>{{item.display_name}} · {{item.skills}}</label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">暂无本市师傅，请联系管理员完善师傅所属城市。</view><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存门店师傅</button></view>